id: pm-r0p3at
title: "GH-1150: health remediation for pending merge receipts must perform the repair"
description: "GitHub issue #1150 reproduces pm health emitting pm merge reconcile --dry-run as the machine-executable remediation for merge_receipts_pending and history_drift_merge_receipt. The named command exits zero without applying state, so an autonomous agent loops between a red health gate and a successful no-op."
type: Issue
status: closed
priority: 1
tags: []
created_at: "2026-08-29T04:05:49.104Z"
updated_at: "2026-08-29T04:25:36.533Z"
closed_at: "2026-08-29T04:25:36.061Z"
completed_at: "2026-08-29T04:25:36.061Z"
author: "harness:codex"
estimated_minutes: 180
acceptance_criteria: "The remediation registry returns pm merge reconcile without --dry-run for pending merge receipt health findings; Preview guidance still teaches the optional dry-run review step before apply where human review is appropriate; SDK health, generated contracts, docs, temporary merge acceptance, and exact coverage pass"
parent: pm-dj98
risk: medium
confidence: high
reporter: GitHub issue #1150
severity: high
environment: pm 2026.8.28 in a fresh two-branch repository with one pending lossless merge receipt
repro_steps: "Create divergent agent branches, merge one branch, run pm health --strict-exit, execute its remediation verbatim, and observe the pending receipt remains because --dry-run applies nothing."
resolution: Changed the shared SDK remediation registry so pending lossless merge receipt and receipt-attributed history drift findings name the state-changing pm merge reconcile command while retaining dry-run as optional preview guidance.
expected_result: An agent executing either pending-receipt remediation verbatim settles the receipt and clears health; optional preview remains explicitly documented.
actual_result: "Both health remediation maps now emit pm merge reconcile. Focused 26-test integration, an exact two-branch manual temporary-repository workflow, 8,108-test exact coverage, docstring and governance assurance, ESLint, duplication, and packed npm/Bun smoke pass; only the previously A/B-reproduced local RSS transport variance remains for hosted exact-head arbitration."
affected_version: 2026.8.28
fixed_version: 2026.8.29
component: "SDK diagnostics remediation registry, health, merge reconciliation, and agent guidance"
regression: true
customer_impact: Autonomous agents treat a successful no-op as repair and enter a self-perpetuating health remediation loop after otherwise-correct multi-agent merges.
